{#
    The ✥ move tool of ONE user-movable element ("Uživatel může posunout",
    axis-move plan M3) — a dot in the box's tool cluster, after the pencil.
    ↕ / ↔ when the designer allowed one axis only. Behaviour-free markup:
    fill_element_move.js (owned by variant-fill-overlay) handles it by
    delegation — press-and-drag moves the element along the allowed axes,
    a click (≤ 3 px of travel) or Enter selects it ("move mode": drag the
    box, arrow keys, the offset chip).

    Params: m = one FillMovableElements row.
#}
{% set glyph = m.allowance.vertical and m.allowance.horizontal ? 'move' : (m.allowance.vertical ? 'move-v' : 'move-h') %}
<button type="button" class="fill-box__tool fill-box__tool--move"
    data-move-tool="{{ m.id }}"
    title="Posunout — táhněte, nebo klikněte a posouvejte šipkami"
    aria-label="Posunout: {{ m.name }}"
>{{ icon(glyph, 's14') }}</button>
